[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0020","text":"冬优子……你没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0030","text":"怎么了——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0040","text":"不，我是想你是不是积了太多疲劳"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0050","text":"最近一直连轴转嘛\n如果情况严重的话…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0060","text":"你要是能把这分关心\n用来假装没看见就好了呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0070","text":"啊，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0080","text":"……没事的\n只是有点累而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0090","text":"倒是你，别光顾着担心别人\n也好好照顾一下自己的身体"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_01_0100","text":"…………"}]
